9.jpg)\n例句\nSomehow the children ==contrived== to finish the whole puzzle in five minutes.","fields":{"Front":"contrive","Back":"释义\nv. 谋划（不好的）\n词根词缀\ncon- + trive（找到，词源 trover 发现）→ 想歪点子硬凑出来 → 谋划（不当手段）\n![contrive](media:jj_449.jpg)\n例句\nSomehow the children ==contrived== to finish the whole puzzle in five minutes.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","cloze":"","tags":["jijing"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-16T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-16T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[{"name":"jj_449.jpg","mime":"image/jpeg"}],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"jj_3_00810822","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"convene","back":"释义\nv. 召集\n词根词缀\ncon-（共同）+ vene（来）→ 大家来到一起 → 召集、开会\n![convene](media:jj_450.jpg)\n例句\nThe committee will ==convene== next Monday to discuss the issue.","fields":{"Front":"convene","Back":"释义\nv. 召集\n词根词缀\ncon-（共同）+ vene（来）→ 大家来到一起 → 召集、开会\n![convene](media:jj_450.jpg)\n例句\nThe committee will ==convene== next Monday to discuss the issue.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","cloze":"","tags":["jijing"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-16T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-16T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[{"name":"jj_450.jpg","mime":"image/jpeg"}],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"jj_3_00810824","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"converge","back":"释义\nv. 聚合\n词根词缀\ncon-（共同）+ verge（倾斜、转向）→ 各方转向同一点 → 聚合、汇聚\n![converge](media:jj_451.jpg)\n例句\nThe two roads ==converge== just outside the town.","fields":{"Front":"converge","Back":"释义\nv. 聚合\n词根词缀\ncon-（共同）+ verge（倾斜、转向）→ 各方转向同一点 → 聚合、汇聚\n![converge](media:jj_451.jpg)\n例句\nThe two roads ==converge== just outside the town.","Extra":"","Source