）+ last（持续撑住，同 last）+ icity → 拉得开又弹得回 → 弹性、灵活性\n![elasticity](media:jj_518.jpg)\n例句\nThe ==elasticity== of the material allows it to stretch and recover.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","cloze":"","tags":["jijing"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-16T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-16T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[{"name":"jj_518.jpg","mime":"image/jpeg"}],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"jj_4_01053926","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"elicit","back":"释义\nv. 引出\n词根词缀\ne-（出）+ licit（引，词源 lacere 诱）→ 把潜在的东西引出来 → 引出、诱发\n![elicit](media:jj_519.jpg)\n例句\nThe question ==elicited== a long silence and then a single tear.","fields":{"Front":"elicit","Back":"释义\nv. 引出\n词根词缀\ne-（出）+ licit（引，词源 lacere 诱）→ 把潜在的东西引出来 → 引出、诱发\n![elicit](media:jj_519.jpg)\n例句\nThe question ==elicited== a long silence and then a single tear.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","cloze":"","tags":["jijing"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-16T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-16T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[{"name":"jj_519.jpg","mime":"image/jpeg"}],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"jj_4_01053928","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"elide","back":"释义\nv. 省略\n词根词缀\ne-（出）+ lid（打掉，同 collide 撞）→ 把多余的敲掉 → 省略、删去\n![elide](media:jj_520.jpg)\n例句\nThe poet chose to ==elide== certain words for the sake of rhythm.","fields":{"Front":"elide","Back":"释义\nv. 省略\n词根词缀\ne-（出）+ lid（打掉，同 collide 撞）→ 把多余的敲掉 → 省略、删去\n![elide](media:jj_520.jpg)\n例句\nThe poet chose to ==elide== certain words for the sake of rhythm.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","cloze":"","tags":["jijing"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt