":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[{"name":"jj_561.jpg","mime":"image/jpeg"}],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"jj_5_00811847","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"fanciful","back":"释义\nadj. 幻想的\n词根词缀\nfancy（幻想）+ ful → 满脑子奇思妙想 → 想象出来的、异想天开的\n![fanciful](media:jj_562.jpg)\n例句\nThe novel is full of ==fanciful== creatures and magical places.","fields":{"Front":"fanciful","Back":"释义\nadj. 幻想的\n词根词缀\nfancy（幻想）+ ful → 满脑子奇思妙想 → 想象出来的、异想天开的\n![fanciful](media:jj_562.jpg)\n例句\nThe novel is full of ==fanciful== creatures and magical places.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","cloze":"","tags":["jijing"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-16T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-16T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[{"name":"jj_562.jpg","mime":"image/jpeg"}],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"jj_5_00811849","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"feasible","back":"释义\nadj. 可行的\n词根词缀\nfeas（做，同 feat 功绩、feasible 的 ficere）+ ible → 能做得出来 → 可行的\n![feasible](media:jj_563.jpg)\n例句\nIs it really ==feasible== to finish the work in one week?","fields":{"Front":"feasible","Back":"释义\nadj. 可行的\n词根词缀\nfeas（做，同 feat 功绩、feasible 的 ficere）+ ible → 能做得出来 → 可行的\n![feasible](media:jj_563.jpg)\n例句\nIs it really ==feasible== to finish the work in one week?","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","cloze":"","tags":["jijing"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-16T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-16T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[{"name":"jj_563.jpg","mime":"image/jpeg"}],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"jj_5_00811851","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"fecundity","back":"释义\nn. 丰富\n词根词缀\nfec（生育，同 fecund 肥沃多产）+ undity → 生育力爆棚 → 多产、丰饶\n![fecundity](media:jj_564.jpg)\n例句\nThe ==fecundity== of the soil supports a rich harvest each year.","fields":{"Front":"fecundity","Back":"释义\nn. 丰富\n词根词缀\nfec（生育，同 fecund 肥沃多产）+ undity → 生育力爆棚 → 多产、丰饶\n![fecundity](media:jj_564.jpg)\n例句\nThe ==fecundity== of the soil supports a rich harvest each year.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","cloze":"","tags":["jijing"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-16T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-16T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[{"name":"jj_564.jpg","mime":"image/jpeg"}],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"jj_5_00811853","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"felicity","back":"释义\nn. 幸福\n词根词缀\nfel（幸福，同 felix 幸运的猫）+ icity → 幸福的状态；也指措辞的巧妙贴切\n![felicity](media:jj_565.jpg)\n例句\nThe poet wrote of the ==felicity== of a simple country life.","fields":{"Front":"felicity","Back":"释义\nn. 幸福\n词根词缀\nfel（幸福，同 felix 幸运的猫）+ icity → 幸福的状态；也指措辞的巧妙贴切\n![felicity](media:jj_565.jpg)\n例句\nThe poet wrote of the ==felicity== of a simple country life.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","cloze":"","tags":["jijing"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-16T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-16T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[{"name":"jj_565.jpg","mime":"image/jpeg"}],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"jj_5_00811855","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"fictitious","back":"释义\nadj. 想象的\n词根词缀\nfict（塑造，同 fiction 小说）+ itious → 塑造出来的 → 虚构的、假的\n![fictitious](media:jj_566.jpg)\n例句\nAll the characters in the story are completely ==fictitious==.","fields":{"Front":"fictitious","Back":"释义\nadj. 想象的\n词根词缀\nfict（塑造，同 fiction 小说）+ itious → 塑造出来的 → 虚构的、假的\n![fictitious](media:jj_566.jpg)\n例句\nAll the characters in the