= appearance.","fields":{"Front":"imposing","Back":"释义\nadj. 壮观的\n词根词缀\nim-（进入）+ pos（放）+ ing → 往人眼前一杵、气势压人 → 壮观的、威严的\n![imposing](media:jj_601.jpg)\n例句\nThe ancient castle has a truly ==imposing== appearance.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","cloze":"","tags":["jijing"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-16T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-16T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[{"name":"jj_601.jpg","mime":"image/jpeg"}],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"jj_5_00811927","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"imposition","back":"释义\nn. 强加\n词根词缀\nim-（进入）+ pos（放）+ ition → 硬塞给人 → 强加、（税）征收\n![imposition](media:jj_602.jpg)\n例句\nThe new tax was seen as an unfair ==imposition== on small shops.","fields":{"Front":"imposition","Back":"释义\nn. 强加\n词根词缀\nim-（进入）+ pos（放）+ ition → 硬塞给人 → 强加、（税）征收\n![imposition](media:jj_602.jpg)\n例句\nThe new tax was seen as an unfair ==imposition== on small shops.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","cloze":"","tags":["jijing"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-16T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-16T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[{"name":"jj_602.jpg","mime":"image/jpeg"}],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"jj_5_00811929","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"incentive for","back":"释义\nn. 对…的激励\n词根词缀\nin-（进入）+ cent（唱，同 chant 咏唱激励）+ ive → 唱着歌鼓劲的东西 → 激励、动机\n![incentive for](media:jj_603.jpg)\n例句\nThe bonus is a strong ==incentive for== better performance.","fields":{"Front":"incentive for","Back":"释义\nn. 对…的激励\n词根词缀\nin-（进入）+ cent（唱，同 chant 咏唱激励）+ ive → 唱着歌鼓劲的东西 → 激励、动机\n![incentive for](media:jj_603.jpg)\n例句\nThe bonus is a strong ==incentive for== better performance.","Extra":"","Source":""},"e