ers came to ==install== a new heating system in the house.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","cloze":"","tags":["jijing"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-16T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-16T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[{"name":"jj_625.jpg","mime":"image/jpeg"}],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"jj_6_03499321","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"insufficient","back":"释义\nadj. 不足的\n词根词缀\nin-（不）+ sufficient（足够的，同 suffice）→ 不够用的 → 不足的\n![insufficient](media:jj_626.jpg)\n例句\nThere is ==insufficient== evidence to support the strange claim.","fields":{"Front":"insufficient","Back":"释义\nadj. 不足的\n词根词缀\nin-（不）+ sufficient（足够的，同 suffice）→ 不够用的 → 不足的\n![insufficient](media:jj_626.jpg)\n例句\nThere is ==insufficient== evidence to support the strange claim.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","cloze":"","tags":["jijing"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-16T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-16T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[{"name":"jj_626.jpg","mime":"image/jpeg"}],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"jj_6_03499323","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"insuperable","back":"释义\nadj. 不可逾越的\n词根词缀\nin-（不）+ super（越过）+ able → 翻不过去 → 不可逾越的\n![insuperable](media:jj_627.jpg)\n例句\nThe language barrier proved to be an ==insuperable== problem.","fields":{"Front":"insuperable","Back":"释义\nadj. 不可逾越的\n词根词缀\nin-（不）+ super（越过）+ able → 翻不过去 → 不可逾越的\n![insuperable](media:jj_627.jpg)\n例句\nThe language barrier proved to be an ==insuperable== problem.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","cloze":"","tags":["jijing"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-16T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-1