ious ==misgiving== about the risky plan.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","cloze":"","tags":["jijing"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-16T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-16T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[{"name":"jj_655.jpg","mime":"image/jpeg"}],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"jj_6_03499381","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"mitigate","back":"释义\nv. 减轻\n词根词缀\nmit（温和，同 mild 柔和）+ igate → 调成温和模式 → 减轻、缓和\n![mitigate](media:jj_656.jpg)\n例句\nWearing a helmet can ==mitigate== the risk of head injury.","fields":{"Front":"mitigate","Back":"释义\nv. 减轻\n词根词缀\nmit（温和，同 mild 柔和）+ igate → 调成温和模式 → 减轻、缓和\n![mitigate](media:jj_656.jpg)\n例句\nWearing a helmet can ==mitigate== the risk of head injury.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","cloze":"","tags":["jijing"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-16T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-16T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[{"name":"jj_656.jpg","mime":"image/jpeg"}],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"jj_6_03499383","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"moderation","back":"释义\nn. 节制\n词根词缀\nmoder（适度，同 moderate 中等的）+ ation → 不过火 → 节制、适度\n![moderation](media:jj_657.jpg)\n例句\nThe doctor told him to eat everything in ==moderation==.","fields":{"Front":"moderation","Back":"释义\nn. 节制\n词根词缀\nmoder（适度，同 moderate 中等的）+ ation → 不过火 → 节制、适度\n![moderation](media:jj_657.jpg)\n例句\nThe doctor told him to eat everything in ==moderation==.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","cloze":"","tags":["jijing"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-16T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-16T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"du