ation.","fields":{"Front":"momentous","Back":"释义\nadj. 重大的\n词根词缀\nmoment（分量、时刻）+ ous → 有分量的时刻 → 重大的、关键的\n![momentous](media:jj_660.jpg)\n例句\nIt was a ==momentous== day in the history of the nation.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","cloze":"","tags":["jijing"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-16T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-16T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[{"name":"jj_660.jpg","mime":"image/jpeg"}],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"jj_6_03499391","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"multifaceted","back":"释义\nadj. 多种多样的\n词根词缀\nmulti（多）+ facet（切面，宝石的面）+ ed → 像钻石一样有很多面 → 多面的、多才多艺的\n![multifaceted](media:jj_661.jpg)\n例句\nThe issue has many ==multifaceted== dimensions that defy simple answers.","fields":{"Front":"multifaceted","Back":"释义\nadj. 多种多样的\n词根词缀\nmulti（多）+ facet（切面，宝石的面）+ ed → 像钻石一样有很多面 → 多面的、多才多艺的\n![multifaceted](media:jj_661.jpg)\n例句\nThe issue has many ==multifaceted== dimensions that defy simple answers.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","cloze":"","tags":["jijing"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-16T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-16T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[{"name":"jj_661.jpg","mime":"image/jpeg"}],"reviewLog":[]}]},{"id":"jijing-07","name":"基金（鸡精）› List 7","description":"SAT 鸡精词汇 · List 7","createdAt":"2026-11-16T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-16T00:00:00.000Z","tags":["jijing","apkg","imported"],"options":{"newPerDay":null,"reviewsPerDay":null,"learningSteps":null,"relearningSteps":null,"graduatingInterval":null,"easyInterval":null,"leechThreshold":null,"leechAction":"","buryRelated":null,"maxInterval":null,"requestRetention":null,"newOrder":"","reviewOrde