":[{"name":"jj_689.jpg","mime":"image/jpeg"}],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"jj_7_03532111","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"palpable","back":"释义\nadj. 可触摸的、明显的\n词根词缀\npalp（摸，同 palpate 触诊）+ able → 摸得到的 → 明显的、摸得着的（紧张感 palpable）\n![palpable](media:jj_690.jpg)\n例句\nThe tension in the room was almost ==palpable==.","fields":{"Front":"palpable","Back":"释义\nadj. 可触摸的、明显的\n词根词缀\npalp（摸，同 palpate 触诊）+ able → 摸得到的 → 明显的、摸得着的（紧张感 palpable）\n![palpable](media:jj_690.jpg)\n例句\nThe tension in the room was almost ==palpable==.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","cloze":"","tags":["jijing"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-16T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-16T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[{"name":"jj_690.jpg","mime":"image/jpeg"}],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"jj_7_03532113","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"paradigm","back":"释义\nn. 范式\n词根词缀\npara（并排展示）+ digm（显示，同 deictic 指示）→ 摆出来当样板 → 范式、典范\n![paradigm](media:jj_691.jpg)\n例句\nThe discovery introduced a completely new ==paradigm== in physics.","fields":{"Front":"paradigm","Back":"释义\nn. 范式\n词根词缀\npara（并排展示）+ digm（显示，同 deictic 指示）→ 摆出来当样板 → 范式、典范\n![paradigm](media:jj_691.jpg)\n例句\nThe discovery introduced a completely new ==paradigm== in physics.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","cloze":"","tags":["jijing"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-16T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-16T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[{"name":"jj_691.jpg","mime":"image/jpeg"}],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"jj_7_03532115","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"partition","back":"释义\nn. 分区\n词根词缀\npart（部分）+ ition → 把整体切成几块 → 分区、隔断\n![partition](media:jj_692.jpg)\n例句\nThe wall serves as a ==partition== between the two rooms.","fields":{"Front":"partition","Back":"释义\nn. 分区\n词根词缀\npart（部分）+ ition → 把整体切成几块 → 分区、隔断\n![partition](media:jj_692.jpg)\n例句\nThe wall serves as a ==partition== between the two rooms.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","cloze":"","tags":["jijing"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-16T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-16T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[{"name":"jj_692.jpg","mime":"image/jpeg"}],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"jj_7_03532117","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"paucity","back":"释义\nn. 缺乏\n词根词缀\npauc（少，同 few 词源 paucus）+ ity → 少得可怜 → 缺乏、少量\n![paucity](media:jj_693.jpg)\n例句\nThe ==paucity== of evidence made the verdict almost impossible.","fields":{"Front":"paucity","Back":"释义\nn. 缺乏\n词根词缀\npauc（少，同 few 词源 paucus）+ ity → 少得可怜 → 缺乏、少量\n![paucity](media:jj_693.jpg)\n例句\nThe ==paucity== of evidence made the verdict almost impossible.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","cloze":"","tags":["jijing"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-16T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-16T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[{"name":"jj_693.jpg","mime":"image/jpeg"}],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"jj_7_03532119","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"peculiar","back":"释义\nadj. 奇特的\n词根词缀\npecul（私产，同 pecuniary 钱财）+ iar → 自家特有的 → 独特的、古怪的\n![peculiar](media:jj_694.jpg)\n例句\nThere is something quite ==peculiar== about the old house.","fields":{"Front":"peculiar","Back":"释义\nadj. 奇特的\n词根词缀\npecul（私产，同 pecuniary 钱财）+ iar → 自家特有的 → 独特的、古怪的\n![peculiar](media:jj_694.jpg)\n例句\nThere is something quite ==peculiar== about the old house.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","cloze":"","