ovate](media:jj_763.jpg)\n例句\nThey plan to ==renovate== the old kitchen next summer.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","cloze":"","tags":["jijing"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-16T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-16T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[{"name":"jj_763.jpg","mime":"image/jpeg"}],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"jj_8_03564124","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"repository","back":"释义\nn. 储藏处\n词根词缀\nre（回）+ pos（放）+ itory（地方）→ 放回去存起来的地方 → 储藏处、知识库\n![repository](media:jj_764.jpg)\n例句\nThe library is a rich ==repository== of old books and documents.","fields":{"Front":"repository","Back":"释义\nn. 储藏处\n词根词缀\nre（回）+ pos（放）+ itory（地方）→ 放回去存起来的地方 → 储藏处、知识库\n![repository](media:jj_764.jpg)\n例句\nThe library is a rich ==repository== of old books and documents.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","cloze":"","tags":["jijing"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-16T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-16T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[{"name":"jj_764.jpg","mime":"image/jpeg"}],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"jj_8_03564126","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"repudiate","back":"释义\nv. 否认\n词根词缀\nre（回）+ pud（羞耻，同 pudency 羞怯）+ iate → 让对方丢脸断绝关系 → 否认、拒绝承认\n![repudiate](media:jj_765.jpg)\n例句\nThe writer was forced to ==repudiate== the false statement.","fields":{"Front":"repudiate","Back":"释义\nv. 否认\n词根词缀\nre（回）+ pud（羞耻，同 pudency 羞怯）+ iate → 让对方丢脸断绝关系 → 否认、拒绝承认\n![repudiate](media:jj_765.jpg)\n例句\nThe writer was forced to ==repudiate== the false statement.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","cloze":"","tags":["jijing"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-16T00:00:00.