rficial== .","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","cloze":"","tags":["jijing"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-16T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-16T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[{"name":"jj_818.jpg","mime":"image/jpeg"}],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"jj_9_03597128","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"superfluous","back":"释义\nadj. 多余的\n词根词缀\nsuper（超出）+ flu（流）+ ous → 满得往外溢 → 多余的、过剩的\n![superfluous](media:jj_819.jpg)\n例句\nThe third paragraph is ==superfluous== and only weakens the argument.","fields":{"Front":"superfluous","Back":"释义\nadj. 多余的\n词根词缀\nsuper（超出）+ flu（流）+ ous → 满得往外溢 → 多余的、过剩的\n![superfluous](media:jj_819.jpg)\n例句\nThe third paragraph is ==superfluous== and only weakens the argument.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","cloze":"","tags":["jijing"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-16T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-16T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[{"name":"jj_819.jpg","mime":"image/jpeg"}],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"jj_9_03597130","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"superimpose","back":"释义\nv. 叠加\n词根词缀\nsuper（上面）+ impose（放，同 impose 强加）→ 叠放到上面 → 叠加、叠加显示\n![superimpose](media:jj_820.jpg)\n例句\nThe designer will ==superimpose== one image on top of another.","fields":{"Front":"superimpose","Back":"释义\nv. 叠加\n词根词缀\nsuper（上面）+ impose（放，同 impose 强加）→ 叠放到上面 → 叠加、叠加显示\n![superimpose](media:jj_820.jpg)\n例句\nThe designer will ==superimpose== one image on top of another.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","cloze":"","tags":["jijing"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-16T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-16T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"di