actic== in the debate.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","cloze":"","tags":["jijing"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-16T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-16T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[{"name":"jj_829.jpg","mime":"image/jpeg"}],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"jj_10_03626163","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"tally","back":"释义\nv. 统计\n词根词缀\ntally（刻痕计数，古时木签刻痕记账）→ 划『正』字 → 统计、吻合（accounts tally）\n![tally](media:jj_830.jpg)\n例句\nThe officials will ==tally== all the votes after the election.","fields":{"Front":"tally","Back":"释义\nv. 统计\n词根词缀\ntally（刻痕计数，古时木签刻痕记账）→ 划『正』字 → 统计、吻合（accounts tally）\n![tally](media:jj_830.jpg)\n例句\nThe officials will ==tally== all the votes after the election.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","cloze":"","tags":["jijing"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-16T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-16T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[{"name":"jj_830.jpg","mime":"image/jpeg"}],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"jj_10_03626165","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"tangential","back":"释义\nadj. 不相关的\n词根词缀\ntangent（切线，同 tangent 轻轻碰一下就滑走）+ ial → 只是轻轻擦边 → 不相关的、离题的\n![tangential](media:jj_831.jpg)\n例句\nHis long story about his cousin was ==tangential== to the point at issue.","fields":{"Front":"tangential","Back":"释义\nadj. 不相关的\n词根词缀\ntangent（切线，同 tangent 轻轻碰一下就滑走）+ ial → 只是轻轻擦边 → 不相关的、离题的\n![tangential](media:jj_831.jpg)\n例句\nHis long story about his cousin was ==tangential== to the point at issue.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","cloze":"","tags":["jijing"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-16T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-16T00: